{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_snsant_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_snsant_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "数字问题",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_snsant_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "66ecd38beb052d8e01fe76e31410db69dbae95466cc157264d4ac53257f8bdb5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "真的吗？已经投出去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "嗯，今天早上我直接把打印好的论文给了信使，他一拿到就走了。接下来就看审稿人什么意见，期刊给不给你过啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "谢谢，可露希尔小姐——不，可露希尔导师！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "别，导师我可真算不上。至少在你研究课题所在的这个领域里，我没资格指导你，最多就帮你理理思路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "但写论文的事是可露希尔小姐提议的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "埋没了你这样的人才就太可惜了嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "可露希尔小姐还指导我论文该怎么写！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "毕竟是你人生中的第一篇论文，指点一下是应该的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "可露希尔小姐昨晚还帮我做了最后的修改和润色！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "雪雉妹妹，你说到这个，我可就——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "（打哈欠）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "——不困了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "啊......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "我知道你是自学成才，之前一直在埋头搞研究，也没接触过面向期刊的论文写作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "可你把我写成论文的第一作者干嘛？诱骗我剽窃你吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我、我以为作者顺序不要紧的，为了表示感谢，就......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "我是通讯作者，把我写在你自己名字的后面，谢谢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "呜呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "还有标点符号错误，小标题层级错误，引用也不标清楚，一股脑把参考文献堆在文末......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "要是下一篇论文还写成这样，我就要收润笔费了！一个字一千龙门币！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "对不起！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "最后，雪雉妹妹，告诉我，你为什么要给我交......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "（痛苦地打了个哈欠）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "......手写稿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "现在已经没有期刊收手写稿了！我前半夜把文字部分录进去改好了，后半夜一直在把你画的各种图原样弄到打印稿上去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我算过纸和墨的价钱，打印稿比手写稿贵上两龙门币......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "（双手抱头）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "雪雉，如果我没记错，你是想当大科学家的对吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "要当大科学家，就要多发论文，对吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "嗯，这是你告诉我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "你知道发论文除了油墨和稿纸钱以外还需要什么支出吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "什么支出？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "是版面费。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "版面费？要......要多少？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "根据期刊不同会不一样，少说也得有四位数吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "四四四四四位数？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我我我我算一下应该从哪里把钱省出来......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "（掏出终端）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "（首先，寄回家的钱肯定不能动......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "（然后是自研课题，现在有三个......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "（一个长长的哈欠）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "你也不用太担心——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "（不行，课题的经费也一个都不能动......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "雪雉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "（这下只能压缩伙食费了......呜呜......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "你在听我说话吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "呃，算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "既然这样，你先让我补补觉吧。再过十分钟我就得去跟凯尔希开会了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可露希尔随手抓了本书盖在脸上，往椅子上一倒，发出了均匀的鼾声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "（不知道版面费到底什么时候交......要是能拖上一段时间，或许还能省出来......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "可、可露希尔小姐——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "睡了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "雪雉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "可露希尔小姐睡了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "嗯，睡了，都是我的错......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "我觉得这不是你的错啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "第一次总会出各种各样的问题，一般来说，只要好好向别人道歉，下次改正就好，雷蛇前辈一直是这么安慰我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "嗯，谢谢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "抱歉，不光让你白跑了一趟，还拉你来食堂跟我一起喝白开水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "没关系的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "所以杰西卡刚刚找可露希尔小姐是有什么事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "我的通讯终端出了点问题，可工程部最近很忙，按照正常流程报修，要到三个月之后才能修得上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "我昨天......鼓起勇气去鲁特拉工作室找梅尔小姐，可梅尔小姐也很忙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "刚刚我下定决心去找可露希尔小姐反映问题......结果她睡着了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "那岂不是很糟糕？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "说是问题，其实也没特别影响使用，就是通讯偶尔会断断续续的，大概是优先级比较低，所以被工程部排到了几个月之后。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "有没有试过拆开看看？如果是接触不良一类的问题，也许自己就能修好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "我怕一不小心把里面的元件弄坏掉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "那，给我试试？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "真的可以吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "如果修不好，我就按原样装回去，不用担心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "这么快就修好了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "终端的源石电路里有个小小的金属件生锈了，我给你换了一个。现在通讯应该不会断断续续了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "给！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "哇......让我试试。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "呜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "我不知道该跟谁联系......无缘无故给人打电话，会不会很讨人厌啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "就......随便打一个？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "我、我尽量。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "呃......是雷蛇前辈吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "是的......终端修好了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "完全不会断断续续了......也不会哗啦哗啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "对啊，这样就不会弄混芙兰卡前辈到底是在说正事还是在开玩笑了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "嗯嗯！再见！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "谢谢你，雪雉。我该付你多少钱？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "欸，钱？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "还是别了吧，只是一个金属零件而已，再说这也不是我买的，是从工程部回收的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "零件是零件，你的劳动是你的劳动嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "刚刚雷蛇前辈也说要来找你修终端，也许还有更多人来找你修东西，你总不能一直倒贴零件吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "我觉得你应该收费，这是你应得的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "（更多人......修东西......收费......应得的......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "（版面费！！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "那......那......那我不客气了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "（深呼吸）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "就......二十龙门币......吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "二十块钱？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "可你的版面费不是要四位数吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我知道二十块钱不多，可薄利多销才是做生意的正途，要是把修理的价格定太高了，会没人愿意来的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "所以，二十块钱就好，二十块钱就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "呼......这样就都修好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "让我看看标签......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "这两个是雷蛇和克洛丝的终端。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "还有香草的宠物饮水机和坚雷教官的计算器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "再加上昨天杰西卡的终端，总共是五个二十块钱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "一天下来就是一百块钱，这么赚钱......好像还挺快的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "四位数的版面费......先按五千块算吧......那现在我已经赚到了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "五十分之一......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "还得努力啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "不过，为什么这些通讯终端都出现了一样的问题呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我的就没有，好奇怪啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "哪位？请进。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "是我，杰西卡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "欢迎，这些东西我都修好了，可以拿回去啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "这些是大家付给你的钱，一百龙门币。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "现在就给我吗？万一没修好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "坚雷教官说，让雪雉你来干这种小修小补的工作，已经是大材小用了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "嗯！替我谢谢坚雷教官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "钱我就收下啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "杰西卡，你们的终端为什么都是同一个零件出毛病？这个终端有什么设计上的缺陷吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "我问了雷蛇前辈，好像是这种终端出于性能考虑放弃了部分可靠性，被迫在源石电路中使用了相对容易生锈的材料......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "应该就是你说的那个金属零件了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "在正常环境中用到使用年限倒是没问题，不过经常出外勤的干员会在各种高温高湿的环境里工作，那样终端就坏得快些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "就没有不用那种金属零件的方法吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "我不知道......毕竟连可露希尔小姐都没办法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "对了，还有一件事，坚雷教官让我转告你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "坚雷教官说，修修饮水机和计算器之类的倒是没问题，但终端这种统一配发的东西最好还是让工程部统一维修。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "工程部原则上不赞同私下维修统一配发的装备。私下修理的用料很容易参差不齐，今后的设备维护成本会增加的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "这、这下怎么办，我是不是该去找坚雷教官......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "你先别急。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "坚雷教官最后说，考虑到雪雉你的实际情况和工程部堆积的修理请求，她会对这件事睁一只眼闭一只眼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "她只是提醒你一下，你自己把握就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "（长出一口气）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "那，下次再有人需要你修终端，你还要答应下来吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "这......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我自己把握吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "梓兰的钢笔，二十块钱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "芙蓉的料理机，二十块钱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "四月的随身听，二十块钱——更换按键用了两块钱的零件，顺便把她没注意到的裸露耳机线也换了，花了一块钱，所以是十七块钱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "杜林的指甲刀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "把散架的指甲刀组装起来实在太没技术含量，还是别要钱了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "算下来，这一周只有五十七块钱啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "怎么办，要是生意一直这么差，得到什么时候才能凑够五千块啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "而且版面费真的能等这么长时间吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雪雉躺在椅子上，不由自主地看向桌上的八个待修理的终端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "如果我把它们修好，就是一百六十块！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "不行，不知道工程部的规定还好说，明知故犯就太过分了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "可是，版面费......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "呜呜，我不想在成为大科学家的第一步上就因为没钱而出局......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "要不，干脆换掉源石电路的结构，找个不用金属件的方法，这样还算不算违反工程部的规定？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "可是，连可露希尔小姐都没办法的事，我怎么可能做到啊......",
