    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "等等，今天的课题还没做呢，得先忙那边......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "呼——啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "今天我有种预感，这种接法没准能成。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "该熬个通宵了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "欸？拜托我把你修好的终端收集起来，你要再修一遍？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "因为我发现了一种新的源石电路接法，能把那个容易生锈的金属零件精简掉。",
