    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我记了账的，按照账本来就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "我、雷蛇前辈、克洛丝......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "对了，雪雉，这可是给终端升级换代，总不能还是一个终端二十块钱了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "是啊，这是我自作主张帮大家做的改动，怎么能收大家的钱呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "......啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "雪雉妹妹，你觉悟还挺高嘛。",
