    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "首先，我问你，你的日常工作和自己揽下来的那些课题怎么样了？因为修理铺的生意耽搁了多少？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "完、完全没耽搁！每天的工作都完成了，课题也都在稳步推进中！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "真的？那你每天几点睡啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "也就......三四点钟？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "咳，我们换个话题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "你吓成这个样子，看来对自己开修理铺会引发什么问题已经有数了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "说说？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "私自修理统一配发的装备，可能提高工程部之后的维护成本......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "嗯，认识得还挺到位。谁告诉你的？杰西卡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "是坚雷教官提醒我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "坚雷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "（点头）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "还是老员工懂事——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "等等，她就提醒了你这句话，然后既没制止你也没来向我报告？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "好，又多了一个要算账的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "不关坚雷教官的事，是我自作主张......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "你还有空操心别人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "工程部本来就已经被各种订单和请求压得喘不过气了，说不定终端维修就是压死驮兽的最后一根稻草，明白吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "原本终端上金属件的批号都是同一批，就算坏得有快慢的差别，也不至于差太多，工程部已经在努力挤时间，准备组织统一修理更换了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "被你这么一搞，有些修好了，有些没修好，又给我们多弄出一道统计的工序。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我......我有账本的，帮谁修过终端都记在上面了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "知道你有账本。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "可就算有账本，你修终端用的金属件能保证是同一批吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "不能......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "所以说，为了以后更换方便，工程部还是得把大家的终端重新修一遍，这是资源的浪费！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "这次也就是几十个金属件，但下次可就不一定了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我明白了，我知道错了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "（本来想疾言厉色训她一顿，可她这么听话，这要从哪开始疾言厉色啊......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "总之，我作为工程部的负责人宣布，你的修理铺，从今天起，无限期关停了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我、我接受处罚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "呜呜呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "（糟糕，她真哭了......我是不是说得太过火了？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "唉，别哭，别哭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "（抽鼻子）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "所以你到底为什么要开这个修理铺啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我没钱，交不上版面费......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "版面费？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "不对啊，我之前没告诉你吗——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "啊，好像确实没告诉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "（不行，虽然可怜，但这个教训还是要让她记住的，不能这么快就变成和风细雨了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "总之，下次不许再这么做了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "账本给我，让我看看你到底赚了多少钱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "净利润只有一千块？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "还倒贴材料做要求范围外的修补？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "还有心情给人免单？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "算到最后，你修了将近一百件东西，每件只赚十块钱多一点？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我想着薄利多销，就把价格定成二十块......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "薄利多销也该有个度吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "上次给博士的热水壶换了个电源线，我还趁博士忙着处理文件的时候找他要了五十块呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "咦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "热水壶的电源线没那么贵吧？再说不是买来直接插上去就能用了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "咳，我只是举个例子，举个例子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "虽然对热水壶来说五十块确实多了那么一点，但你修的可是终端啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "修终端这种精密的东西，既要用专用工具拆机，又要小心翼翼地换件，要个五六十块钱不是太正常了嘛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "话又说回来，你的论文基本上算是通过了，只要小修一下就能发表。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "要不是撞见你在宿舍门口开修理铺，我本来是要给你送审稿人意见的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "可露希尔小姐，你说......什么？我的论文......小修一下就能发表？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我没在做梦吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "你觉得呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "不光这个，还有一件好事要告诉你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "（小声）虽然应该一开始就告诉你的，不过现在也不迟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "版面费其实也不用你出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "什什什什什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "我是你的通讯作者，罗德岛是你的工作单位，版面费当然可以申请由罗德岛帮你交，你不用担心钱不够了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "不行，我得掐自己一下......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "痛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "太棒了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "太棒了，可露希尔小姐！我的论文要发表了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "呜呜呜，终于要发表了，我的论文......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "冷静下来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "（擦眼睛）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "版面费本来是两千龙门币，我替你申请了特困优惠，只要一千五百龙门币。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "这一千五百块钱罗德岛帮你出，你就别再天天熬夜做这个修理铺的生意了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "这......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我刚刚才想到，最后还是罗德岛帮我交这笔版面费......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "是啊，怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "这......是不是有点......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "有点什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我，想了想......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "可能，版面费，我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "还是用......自己的钱比较好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "罗德岛和可露希尔小姐对我这么好，我却给你们惹了麻烦，我实在不好意思用你们的钱......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "你的态度我很欣赏，可你还差五百块钱交不上呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "差的钱，要是能靠继续帮大家修东西赚出来......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "啊？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我绝对不会再碰统一配发的装备的！我就帮大家修一修钢笔和饮水机什么的！真的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "对不起！我知道可露希尔小姐已经对我网开一面了，真的很对不起！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "但是像这样不劳而获，用别人的钱交自己的版面费，我晚上会睡不好觉的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "雪雉，你认真的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "（深呼吸）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "是的，我是认真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "能保证不耽误工作和你自己揽的那些课题？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "一定保证！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "离了这批终端，你可能会没生意哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "会有的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "你确定？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我、我可以自己去问大家有什么东西要修，一定会有的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "（苦笑）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "那就随你的便吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "也就是说......我可以继续帮大家修东西了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "难道你还想让我改主意？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "不不不！谢谢可露希尔小姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "记得涨价，别再一单收二十块钱了，我都替你觉得亏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "还有，每天十二点之前给我好好上床睡觉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "这......可能有点......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "这个没得商量。别人熬坏了身体我给病假，你熬坏了身体......我要扣你工资！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "哇啊！好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "最后，我刚刚听你和杰西卡说，你找出了简化掉那个金属件的方法？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "图纸有吧？给我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "看起来居然行得通。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "雪雉，这份图纸我带回去研究一下，做点改良。不出意外的话，工程部统一给终端更新的事就交给你负责了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "欸？我......负责？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "你的图纸，你的思路，又是你熬的夜，当然是你负责。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "还有，这个思路很新颖，等工作告一段落之后继续研究一下，没准你的第二篇论文也就有着落了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "第——第二篇论文！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "可露希尔小姐！第一篇论文还没发出来，现在就想第二篇的事，真的好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "有什么不好的，能者多劳，多劳多得嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "好了，去找杰西卡庆祝吧，我还有会要开，就不陪你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "差点忘了，拿着，审稿人给你的信！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "拜拜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
